  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Investment project with Prantojon Agro Enterprise- Barishal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future Vision:  &#x2022; Becoming the one stop facilitation centre for all the women led SMEs of Bangladesh  &#x2022; Becoming the Best Ecommerce site of Bangladesh &#x2022; Converting the technology to a AI driven platform for both customers and backend operations &#x2022; Promoting BeshiDeshi as a global sourcing hub for Made in Bangladesh products &#x2022; Replicating the same business model in countries like Africa, where root level artisans require support &#x2022; Bringing products produced by indigenous communities into the ecosystem &#x2022; Ensuring employment of indigenous communities and minorities through the ecosystem , BeshiDeshi&apos;s ecosystem provides an opportunity for local artisans to expand their businesses reaching a wider market and attain a sustainable business model for long run. The company&apos;s support, training, financing, and promotion of products help local artisans earn fair prices for their products and improve their standard of living. BeshiDeshi&apos;s efforts to support women entrepreneurs and increase women participation in the ecosystem are commendable. The company&apos;s future vision of becoming a global sourcing hub and replicating its business model in other countries will create employment opportunities and promote indigenous communities&apos; products, contributing to the country&apos;s economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
